OL,3,GNEWSAMarra claims Scottish government
OL,4,A'hoarding power' in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new leader of Scottish Labour has
OL,7,Fclaimed the Scottish government has
OL,8,F"hoarded money and control" at Holyrood
OL,9,Fand called for the decentralisation of
OL,10,Fpowers to local regions.
OL,12,FMichael Marra called on the Scottish
OL,13,Fgovernment to put "power and money" in
OL,14,Fthe hands of "councils, colleges and
OL,15,Findustries" across the country to grow
OL,16,Flocal economies.
OL,18,FIn his inaugural speech to the UK
OL,19,FLabour conference in Liverpool, Marra
OL,20,Furged members not to mistake the SNP's
OL,21,F"progressive posturing" for progressive
OL,22,Fpolitics.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
