OL,3,GNEWSAMarra claims Scottish government
OL,4,A'hoarding power' in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said it was his job to remind the
OL,7,Fpeople of Scotland what Labour stood
OL,8,Ffor after the party's worst ever
OL,9,FHolyrood election result in May.
